00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.360
myself and everyone else who works on the
channel.

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:29.770
I can’t count the number of times when someone
has complimented our email addresses, as weird

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:33.750
as that sounds, and so whether you run a business,
or just want a better email for yourself,

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:36.730
it’s worth getting a custom one with Hover.

